 ## Rollback
 
 Re-run the previous deploy workflow with the last known-good tag.
+
+## Draining a bad node
+
+1. Cordon the node: `kubectl cordon <node>`.
+2. Drain it, respecting disruption budgets: `kubectl drain <node> --ignore-daemonsets`.
+3. Confirm the replacement is `Ready` before terminating the instance.
+
+## Escalation
+
+| Severity | First responder | Escalates to after |
+|---|---|---|
+| SEV-1 | on-call primary | 15 min |
+| SEV-2 | on-call primary | 60 min |
+| SEV-3 | next business day | — |
